sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant App as streamlit_app.py
    participant Node1 as 1. execute_orchestrator
    participant Node2 as 2. execute_retrieval
    participant Node3 as 3. execute_generation
    participant Node4 as 4. execute_verification
    participant Gemini as Gemini Flash Lite
    participant Chroma as ChromaDB

    User->>App: Submits question
    App->>Node1: initial_state (query, history)
    
    rect rgb(20, 30, 50)
        Note over Node1,Gemini: Step 1: Intent Decision & Query Resolution
        Node1->>Gemini: Classify intent & check if pronoun rewrite needed
        Gemini-->>Node1: Decision JSON (Action: call_tool, tool: retrieve_corpus_evidence, resolved_query)
    end

    rect rgb(30, 40, 60)
        Note over Node2,Chroma: Step 2: Dense Semantic Search
        Node1->>Node2: state (resolved_query)
        Node2->>Chroma: similarity_search_with_score(resolved_query, top_k=7)
        Chroma-->>Node2: Top-7 Chunks with L2 distance scores
    end

    rect rgb(20, 30, 50)
        Note over Node3,Gemini: Step 3: Grounded Answer Synthesis
        Node2->>Node3: state (evidence chunks)
        Node3->>Gemini: Prompt with Excerpts + Strict Grounding Rules
        Gemini-->>Node3: Answer JSON (is_answerable, answer text)
    end

    rect rgb(30, 40, 60)
        Note over Node4,Gemini: Step 4: Fact Grounding Audit
        Node3->>Node4: state (draft answer + evidence)
        Node4->>Gemini: Verify if answer is 100% supported by excerpts
        Gemini-->>Node4: Verdict (is_verified: true, status: VERIFIED_SUPPORTED)
    end

    Node4-->>App: Final AgentState
    App-->>User: Renders rich response, badges, citations, and debug chunks
